    Companion to Directory.Build.props, imported at the end of every
    project's evaluation via Microsoft.Cpp.targets. Empty for now — this is
    the deliberate hook point for build-policy targets (e.g. a shared
    post-build SBOM/notice step) called for in
    .docs/design/10-delivery-plan.md, added when a later gate needs one,
    rather than growing ad hoc per-project post-build steps.
  -->
</Project>
